dialogue:
"Darkness."
"..."
"You slowly open your eyes."
"Wet grass beneath your hands. Stars in shapes you do not recognise."

background: ruins.png

dialogue:
"Behind you, ancient ruins — broken columns, stone worn smooth by centuries."
"Something deep inside them is still faintly glowing."

system arrival:
"ISEKAI ARRIVAL"
"You have been summoned to another world."

system alarm:
"SYSTEM INITIALIZING"
"Welcome, Unknown Traveler."
"Identity required."

npc System:
"Please initialize your character."

